wZYriN9788Q7kNvwEqhkaf&_nc_oc=Adq8u_MgC5D4K1Dkmg9aAFZLs1NIQqVQZxrQxXEMy4N9s2SlY37vpo2rkCyFoHFJUKM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJfRqrVZ8L5k1TaF4T54p-6js5iOmsOjX918wksunilbQ&oe=6AA2A51B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape cover-Weather 3 update V1.png", "id": "1062836060076719", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300541_1062836063410052_72115483006641327_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ECGim3oX154Q7kNvwHVK3r_&_nc_oc=AdqxtxJ3cKUG4bUth50CVvaGsMb-Xo5XC-QTNzJH9dDRm0gwHRO8KUevtjbI6rS9Z58&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKp1inIug-1Y1Jiry0dyc2RAEGNhZQTdxAhhzCf0SnhRQ&oe=6AA2A176"}, "display_name": "GRO", "keywords": ["Farming", "GAG", "Garden", "Game", "VR"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                       \n                                                    \n\n\nA farming adventure with GTAG movement. Celebrating 3 months of launch!\n{1961694904718240}\n# GRIND or RISK?\nComplete Harvests of the Day for ez money, OR risk EVERYTHING in Double or Nothing.\n# LIVE EVENTS AND EXCLUSIVE REWARD \nClaim free Welcome Rewards when you first open this update. Join live event Feed the Pond to earn the rarest seeds in the game - **Dollaranana**.\n{1471323561438861}\n# BUILD BUFFED GARDENS\nPlant magical seeds and harvest gigantic fruits. Mutate your crops with rare weathers like Aurora, Solar Flare, Fireworks. Now you can move plants with TROWEL!\n\n# BRAND NEW SKINS AND CURRENCY\nWe added cool new wardrobe with fresh skins and lots of customisations. Get all Fruit Friends skins for the ultimate collection.\n{2021170175493065}\n# Pets Coming Soon\nMagical creatures that help your garden to get mutations, grow bigger plants!\n\nBecome a **GRO BRO: https://discord.gg/gro**\n", "short_descript